---
// LP(apex `maruhi.app/`)— Blume のカスタムページ(docs/notes/web-design-pass.md §4、裁定 D / G)。
// 「最初の 5 分」(ADR-0014 改訂 1)へ導く順: 価値提案 → インストール → サインイン →
// 招待制の案内 / waitlist の置き場(フォームは H6)→ セルフホストへの導線。
// トーン(§2): ダーク基調・アクセント 1 色を限定的に・コード / ターミナルが主役・装飾控えめ・
// セキュリティは淡々と。書いていない機能は謳わない(pre-release・招待制の現状を正しく書く)。
//
// スタイリングは scoped <style>(素の CSS)のみ。色は Blume の theme tokens(--blume-*)を参照し、
// 生 hex を書かない。間隔・寸法は先頭のカスタムプロパティに集約する(ADR-0013 の精神)。
// ユーザーに見える文言は英語(ADR-0017)。
import PageLayout from "blume/components/layout/PageLayout.astro";
import data from "blume:data";

const { config } = data;
const repo = "https://github.com/maruhiapp/maruhi";
const productOrigin = "https://my.maruhi.app";
const title = "maruhi — diskless, end-to-end encrypted secrets";
---

<PageLayout
  site={{ title: config.title, description: config.description }}
  logo={config.logo}
  banner={config.banner}
  navigation={data.navigation}
  favicon={config.favicon}
  fontCssVars={data.fontCssVars}
  themeMode={config.theme.mode}
  searchEnabled={config.search.enabled}
  siteUrl={config.site}
  ogEnabled={config.og.enabled}
  ogImage="/og.png"
  ogImageAlt="The maruhi mark (a vermilion 秘 in a circle) next to the word maruhi"
  ogImageSize={{ width: 1200, height: 630 }}
  page={{ title, description: config.description }}
>
  <div class="lp">
    <section class="hero" id="top">
      <p class="eyebrow">Private preview · invite-only · self-hostable</p>
      <h1>Secrets that never touch a disk.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        maruhi is a general-purpose secrets manager on Cloudflare. Values are encrypted end to end
        on your machine, stay ciphertext on the server, and reach your programs only as in-memory
        environment variables. Everything happens in the CLI.
      </p>
      <pre class="terminal" aria-label="Example maruhi session"><code><span class="prompt">$</span> maruhi login
<span class="out">Opening your browser. Confirm the code <b>PX7Q-4MRH</b> there.</span>
<span class="prompt">$</span> maruhi push DATABASE_URL
<span class="out">Pushed DATABASE_URL (version=1, epoch=1)</span>
<span class="prompt">$</span> maruhi run -- bun start
<span class="out">Serving on http://localhost:3000</span></code></pre>
      <p class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="#install">Install the CLI</a>
        <a class="link" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
        <a class="link" href={repo}>Source on GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
      <h2 id="how-heading">How it works</h2>
      <ul class="cards">
        <li>
          <h3>Zero knowledge</h3>
          <p>
            Encryption happens in the CLI with WebCrypto and HPKE. The server — hosted or yours —
            stores and relays ciphertext, and holds no key that could open it.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Diskless</h3>
          <p>
            <code>maruhi run -- &lt;command&gt;</code> decrypts in memory and injects values into the
            child process's environment. maruhi never writes a <code>.env</code> file.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Nothing phones home</h3>
          <p>
            No telemetry in the CLI, no third-party scripts in the dashboard — and this page loads no
            analytics, no trackers, and no external fonts.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Serverless, self-hostable</h3>
          <p>
            One Cloudflare Worker with D1 and Durable Objects. Run it on your own account with a
            single <code>wrangler deploy</code>, or use the hosted service.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="step" id="install" aria-labelledby="install-heading">
      <h2 id="install-heading">1. Install the CLI</h2>
      <p>
        Linux and macOS, no Bun required. Releases are pre-release tags until <code>v0.1.0</code>, so
        pick the latest tag on the
        <a href={`${repo}/releases`}>Releases page</a> and read the script before running it.
      </p>
      <pre class="terminal"><code><span class="comment"># Replace V with the latest tag on the Releases page</span>
V=&lt;latest-tag&gt;
curl -fsSL "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maruhiapp/maruhi/$&lbrace;V&rbrace;/packaging/install.sh" -o maruhi-install.sh
less maruhi-install.sh          <span class="comment"># read it first — this is a secrets manager</span>
sh maruhi-install.sh --version "$&lbrace;V&rbrace;"</code></pre>
      <p class="fine">
        Prebuilt binaries with checksums, Homebrew (from <code>v0.1.0</code>), and npm
        (<code>bun install -g maruhi@next</code>) are documented in the
        <a href={`${repo}#install-cli`}>README</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="step" id="signin" aria-labelledby="signin-heading">
      <h2 id="signin-heading">2. Sign in</h2>
      <pre class="terminal"><code>maruhi config set server {productOrigin}
maruhi login</code></pre>
      <p>
        <code>maruhi login</code> opens your browser for a GitHub sign-in and shows the same confirmation
        code in the terminal and on the page. Compare them, approve, and you are in. The first time,
        <code>maruhi key generate</code> creates your master key and a recovery code — that is the one
        ceremony zero knowledge asks of you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="step access" id="access" aria-labelledby="access-heading">
      <h2 id="access-heading">3. Get access</h2>
      <p>
        The hosted service at <a href={productOrigin}>my.maruhi.app</a> is in <strong>private
        preview</strong>. Creating an account requires an invite code, which the sign-in page asks
        for. A waitlist opens with the invite-only beta; until then, follow the repository for
        release notes.
      </p>
      <!-- waitlist 導線の置き場(H6 で Workers への POST フォームに差し替える — 静的文言のみ) -->
      <p class="actions" data-waitlist-placeholder>
        <a class="button" href={`${repo}/releases`}>Watch releases on GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="step" id="self-host" aria-labelledby="selfhost-heading">
      <h2 id="selfhost-heading">Or run it yourself</h2>
      <p>
        maruhi is built to be self-hosted: clone the repository, create a D1 database, and
        <code>wrangler deploy</code>. Your deployment is end-to-end encrypted in exactly the same way.
      </p>
      <p class="actions">
        <a class="link" href="/docs/self-hosting">Self-hosting guide</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <p>
        <a href={repo}>GitHub</a> · <a href="/docs">Docs</a> ·
        <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/LICENSE.md`}>License</a> (FSL-1.1-MIT for the server and web,
        MIT for the CLI and crypto)
      </p>
      <p class="fine">
        No analytics, no trackers, no third-party scripts. Type set in
        <a href="/fonts/OFL-Archivo.txt">Archivo</a> and
        <a href="/fonts/OFL-MartianMono.txt">Martian Mono</a> (SIL Open Font License 1.1), served
        from this site. The ㊙ mark derives from Noto Sans CJK JP (SIL OFL 1.1).
      </p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .lp {
    --lp-measure: 44rem;
    --lp-wide: 64rem;
    --lp-gutter: 1.5rem;
    --lp-gap: 1rem;
    --lp-section: 4.5rem;
    --lp-hero-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.25rem);
    --lp-h2-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    --lp-terminal-size: 0.875rem;
    --lp-border: 1px;
    --lp-button-pad: 0.75rem 1.25rem;

    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--lp-gutter) var(--lp-section);
    max-width: var(--lp-wide);
    color: var(--blume-foreground);
    font-family: var(--blume-font-body);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  section,
  .footer {
    padding-top: var(--lp-section);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--lp-gap);
    font-family: var(--blume-font-display);
    font-size: var(--lp-hero-size);
    font-weight: 800;
    /* Archivo の幅軸 — 見出しは幅広・極太で作る(web-design-pass.md §4) */
    font-stretch: 112%;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    max-width: var(--lp-measure);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 var(--lp-gap);
    font-family: var(--blume-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--lp-terminal-size);
    color: var(--blume-muted-foreground);
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0 0 calc(var(--lp-gap) * 2);
    max-width: var(--lp-measure);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--blume-muted-foreground);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--lp-gap);
    font-family: var(--blume-font-display);
    font-size: var(--lp-h2-size);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-stretch: 105%;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 calc(var(--lp-gap) / 2);
    font-family: var(--blume-font-display);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--lp-gap);
    max-width: var(--lp-measure);
  }

  .fine {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--blume-muted-foreground);
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--blume-border);
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: currentColor;
  }

  code {
    font-family: var(--blume-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--blume-code-background);
    border: var(--lp-border) solid var(--blume-border);
    border-radius: calc(var(--blume-radius) / 2);
    padding: 0 0.35em;
  }

  /* ターミナル: コードが主役(§2)。背景は code token、枝葉の装飾は付けない */
  .terminal {
    margin: 0 0 calc(var(--lp-gap) * 1.5);
    padding: var(--lp-gap) calc(var(--lp-gap) * 1.25);
    max-width: var(--lp-measure);
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--blume-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--lp-terminal-size);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--blume-foreground);
    background: var(--blume-code-background);
    border: var(--lp-border) solid var(--blume-border);
    border-radius: var(--blume-radius);
  }

  .terminal code {
    font-size: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .terminal .prompt {
    color: var(--blume-accent);
    user-select: none;
  }

  .terminal .out,
  .terminal .comment {
    color: var(--blume-muted-foreground);
  }

  .terminal b {
    color: var(--blume-foreground);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--lp-gap);
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* アクセントはボタン 1 種に限定する(§2) */
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: var(--lp-button-pad);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--blume-accent-foreground);
    background: var(--blume-accent);
    border-radius: var(--blume-radius);
  }

  .button:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
  }

  .link {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cards {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--lp-gap);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
  }

  .cards li {
    padding: calc(var(--lp-gap) * 1.25);
    background: var(--blume-muted);
    border: var(--lp-border) solid var(--blume-border);
    border-radius: var(--blume-radius);
  }

  .cards p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--blume-muted-foreground);
  }

  .footer {
    border-top: var(--lp-border) solid var(--blume-border);
    margin-top: var(--lp-section);
    padding-top: calc(var(--lp-gap) * 2);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--blume-muted-foreground);
  }
</style>
